TokyoNight Merino is derived from TokyoNight by folke and its contributors:
https://github.com/folke/tokyonight.nvim

The inherited code is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
This fork retains TokyoNight's Neovim highlight and plugin integration work,
replaces its palettes with a Merino adaptation, and adapts its external-app
exports for Merino light and dark appearances.

The Merino source color definitions were extracted from Superlogical Rex.
